{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blockhead</strong> is a 50 level 2D platform puzzle game.\u00a0 You are Blockhead who is lost and needs to find his way home.\u00a0 Over the 50 levels you will encounter various characters and three (3) bullies who will try to stop you getting home.\u00a0 You will have to collect ten (10) tokens in each level to advance to the next level.\u00a0 You will gain the ability to Wipe and Freeze the bullies as you progress.\u00a0 This will assist you in moving through the levels, getting\u00a0 your tokens and advancing to the next level.\u00a0 You can also get a jigsaw puzzle piece in each level, which will reveal a jigsaw puzzle as you play through the game.\u00a0 You must complete each level in one go or you will have to try again.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052910?t=1766026227","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052910/353770ab6a82a28e3b3a78de57f46bdf95d0d328/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766026227","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052910/f99ed9a164e2d03e4b013ffb021fddadb16eb097/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766026227","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052910/f99ed9a164e2d03e4b013ffb021fddadb16eb097/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766026227","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4256000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blockhead</strong> is a 50 level 2D platform puzzle game.\u00a0 You are Blockhead who is lost and needs to find his way home.\u00a0 Over the 50 levels you will encounter various characters and three (3) bullies who will try to stop you getting home.\u00a0 You will have to collect ten (10) tokens in each level to advance to the next level.\u00a0 You will gain the ability to Wipe and Freeze the bullies as you progress.\u00a0 This will assist you in moving through the levels, getting\u00a0 your tokens and advancing to the next level.\u00a0 You can also get a jigsaw puzzle piece in each level, which will reveal a jigsaw puzzle as you play through the game.\u00a0 You must complete each level in one go or you will have to try again.</p>","developers":["camynot"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052910/2accf80a58c1599e9961a4ae378d7c07e6a0b540/header.jpg?t=1766026227","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4052910/955517210/546edbb6a4ff7f995a1dd16bff8ecb66327772ca/1758522646/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758874264","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4052910/955517210/546edbb6a4ff7f995a1dd16bff8ecb66327772ca/1758522646/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758874264","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4052910/955517210/546edbb6a4ff7f995a1dd16bff8ecb66327772ca/1758522646/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758874264","id":257203759,"name":"Gameplay Level 23","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203759/3a941fed0c28e4f432f398c4fcbe5dd6b338dde7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758874264"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4052910/1971513036/b3a584c6cd2288c9a5b1e23f35de49422f391009/1758522394/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758874267","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4052910/1971513036/b3a584c6cd2288c9a5b1e23f35de49422f391009/1758522394/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758874267","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4052910/1971513036/b3a584c6cd2288c9a5b1e23f35de49422f391009/1758522394/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758874267","id":257203753,"name":"Gameplay Le